{{dercat|osp|ine-pro}}
{{inh+|osp|la|spero|spērāre}}.

===Verb===
{{head|osp|verb}}

# to [[wait]] (for), [[await]]
#* {{quote-book|osp|year=c. 1200|author=Almerich|title=La fazienda de ultramar|note=(published by Moshé Lazar, 1965, Salamanca: Universidad de Salamanca, page 211)|text=En est logar dize Ysayas de Messias que '''esperan''' los Judios e non conoscen com es venido.|t=In this place, Isaiah speaks of the Messiah whom the Jews '''await''', and whom they don't know he [already] came.}}
# to [[hope]], [[expect]]
#* {{quote-book|osp|year=c. 1280|author=Alfonso X|title=General Estoria, tercera parte|note=(published by Pedro Sánchez-Prieto Borja and Bautista Horcajada Diezma, 1994, Madrid: Gredos)|text=mientre fían en los ídolos, que son cosas sin entendimiento e sin alma, juran mal, e '''esperan''' que les non nozirá.|t=While putting trust in idols, which are things without understanding nor soul, they wrongly make oaths and '''expect''' it will not harm them.}}
# to [[trust]] completely {{q|in God}}
#* {{quote-book|osp|year=c. 1280|author=Alfonso X|title=General Estoria, tercera parte|note=(published by Pedro Sánchez-Prieto Borja and Bautista Horcajada Diezma, 1994, Madrid: Gredos)|text=Toda palabra de Dios es escudo fecho con fuego para los que '''esperan''' en él.|t=The word of God is a shield made of fire for those who '''trust''' in Him.}}

