==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|pt|ine-pro}}
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|esperar}}, {{inh+|pt|la|spērō|spērāre|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb}}

# to [[wait]]
## {{senseid|pt|to await}} {{lb|pt|transitive|or|intransitive}} to [[wait]] (for); to [[await]] {{+obj|pt|dirobj/:por<something>}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Eu '''espero''' por sua resposta.|I '''await''' your response.}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Fiquei '''esperando''' no carro.|I '''waited''' in the car.}}
##: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}
## {{senseid|pt|to wait for something to happen}} {{lb|pt|catenative}} to [[wait]] {{+obj|pt|subject&pronoun<qq:optional><for someone> + pers&inf<to do something>}}
##: {{uxi|pt|'''Espere''' o João chegar.|'''Wait''' for John to arrive.}}
##: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}
# to [[hope]]
## {{senseid|pt|to hope for}} {{lb|pt|intransitive}} to [[hope]] for {{gl|to really want}} {{+obj|pt|:por<something>}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Eles '''esperam''' pelo fim da guerra.|They '''hope''' for the end of the war.}}
## {{senseid|pt|to hope that}} {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[hope]] {{+obj|pt|:que(sub-cl)<that someone does something>}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Eu '''espero''' que gostes do presente.|I '''hope''' you like the gift.}}
## {{senseid|pt|to hope something can be done}} {{lb|pt|catenative}} to [[hope]] {{+obj|pt|inf<to do something>|subject&pronoun<qq:optional><for someone> + pers&inf<to something>}}
##: {{uxi|pt|'''Esperávamos''' comer alguma coisa hoje.|'''We were hoping''' to eat something today.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to expect}} to [[expect]]; to [[anticipate]] {{gl|to know or think that something will happen}} {{+obj|pt|dirobj/:por<something>}}
#: {{uxi|pt|É melhor do que eu '''esperava'''.|It is better than I '''expected'''.}}
#: {{uxi|pt|Eu já '''esperava''' por isso mesmo.|I was '''expecting this''' anyway.}}
#: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}

====Conjugation====
{{pt-conj}}

