==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|es|ine-pro}}
From {{inh|es|osp|esperar}}, {{inh+|es|la|spērō|spērāre|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr|+<audio:Es-esperar.ogg>}}

===Verb===
{{es-verb}}

# {{lb|es|transitive|or|catenative}} to [[hope]] {{+obj|es|dirobj<for something>/inf<to do something>/:que(sub-cl)<that something happens>}}
#: {{syn|es|[[tener]] [[esperanza]] de que}}
#: {{coi|es|'''esperar''' con interés|to look forward to, to eagerly await}}
#: {{uxi|es|En vano '''esperaron''' mejores días.|They '''hoped for''' better days in vain.}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''Esperamos''' llegar a viejos juntos.|We '''hope''' we'll grow old together.}}
#: {{uxi|es|Ella '''espera''' ya estar casada cuando tenga treinta.|She '''hopes''' she'll be already married when she's 30 years old.}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''Espera''' que no sea necesario.|He '''hopes''' it won't be necessary.}}
# {{lb|es|transitive|or|catenative}} to [[expect]] {{+obj|es|dirobj<something>/inf<to do something>/:que(ind-cl)<that something happens>}}
#: {{syn|es|anticipar}}
#: {{uxi|es|Ellos '''esperan''' encontrar muchas dificultades.|They '''expect''' to come across many hardships.}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''Esperamos''' un clima adverso mañana.|We're '''expecting''' unfavourable weather tomorrow.}}
#: {{uxi|es|Los estudiantes '''esperan''' que no será fácil el examen.|The students '''expect''' the exam won't be easy.}}
#: {{uxi|es|Los huéspedes '''esperan''' que les ayudaremos.|The guests '''expect''' we'll help them.}}
# {{lb|es|intransitive|or|transitive}} to [[wait]], [[wait for|wait (for)]] {{+obj|es|dirobj<for something>/:[[a]] [[que]](sub-cl)<for something to happen><q*:optionally>}}
#: {{uxi|es|Por favor '''espera''' [[aquí]].|Please '''wait''' here.}}
#: {{uxi|es|Te '''he esperado''' por media hora.|I '''have waited for''' you for half an hour.}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''Espero''' con ansias tu llegada.|I '''am''' anxiously '''waiting for''' your arrival.}}
#: {{uxi|es|¡'''Espera''' a que la conozcas en persona!|'''Wait''' till you meet her in person!}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''Estamos esperando''' a que se suavice la lluvia.|We're '''waiting''' for the rain to get less heavy.}}
# {{lb|es|intransitive|reflexive}} to [[wait]], to [[hold on]] {{gl|''reflexive'' for emphatic use}}
#: {{uxi|es|¡Espera! ¡'''Espérate''' tantito!|Wait! '''Hold on''' for a sec!}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive|impersonal}} to be [[expected]]
#: {{uxi|es|'''Se espera''' que el huracán llegue mañana.|The hurricane '''is expected''' to come tomorrow.}}

